    "content" : "I updated to  <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"ot-hashtag\" href=\"https://plus.google.com/s/%23windows81preview\">#windows81preview</a>   and opened up the task manager for no reason in particular and was surprised at what I saw. I really like the UI for this and all the information that they make available to you. I don&#39;t know if Windows 8 had the same interface, but feel free to use this site to help you get Windows 8.1 set up: <a href=\"http://www.pocket-lint.com/news/121043-windows-8-1-release-date-and-what-you-need-to-know-to-get-ready\" class=\"ot-anchor\">http://www.pocket-lint.com/news/121043-windows-8-1-release-date-and-what-you-need-to-know-to-get-ready</a><br /><br />Edit: Posting this caused Internet Explorer to crash. I&#39;m still sticking with Windows 7 for the time being, just thought it would be fun to see what the next version of Windows 8 looked like.",
    "objectType" : "note",
    "originalContent" : "I updated to  #windows81preview   and opened up the task manager for no reason in particular and was surprised at what I saw. I really like the UI for this and all the information that they make available to you. I don't know if Windows 8 had the same interface, but feel free to use this site to help you get Windows 8.1 set up: http://www.pocket-lint.com/news/121043-windows-8-1-release-date-and-what-you-need-to-know-to-get-ready\n\nEdit: Posting this caused Internet Explorer to crash. I'm still sticking with Windows 7 for the time being, just thought it would be fun to see what the next version of Windows 8 looked like.",
